# Source spreadsheet for franchise-data.js (see tools/build_franchise_data.py).
# Only the generated data goes on the public site, not the raw file.
Book.xlsx

# The Claude page build: the full, unfiltered session logs. LAN only, never commit.
tools/claude-timeline/dist/

# The Encyclopedia's rendered Confluence section, cached between builds (Coles content: never commit)
tools/claude-timeline/.cache/

# Mermaid for the Encyclopedia tab (3.5 MB): build.py fetches it once (encyclopedia.py)
tools/claude-timeline/vendor/

# Python bytecode (build.py imports todo.py)
__pycache__/

# Raw Spotify exports have IP addresses and devices: never commit them. They live
# outside this repo in ../../_workspace/spotify-exports/<person>/ (Parth's moved
# there from _spotify_raw/ on 2026-11-24). tools/build_music_data.py turns them
# into music-data*.js, which hold only totals and top lists. The old folder stays
# ignored in case a copy is ever dropped here again.
_spotify_raw/

# React pages: dependencies (react-src/ is built into music-explorer.js and movie-tracker.js)
react-src/node_modules/

# Car Shows: the home-network address of n8n (pull_car_events.py). Never commit it.
tools/car_events/source_url.txt
data/*.tmp

# Avatars and scans opened in the 3D Scan Viewer / Avatar Lab while testing. Parth's are
# private (a body scan of him). tools/model_guard.py (pre-commit) also blocks model files
# outside play/ and vendor/.
*.vrm
parth_avatar*
parth_scan*
